<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, viewport-fit=cover"><meta name="theme-color" content="#142c2b"><title>星露配方 · 微光调制室</title><link rel="icon" href="./icon.svg" type="image/svg+xml"><link rel="stylesheet" href="./styles.css"></head>
<body>
<div class="ambient" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div id="shell" class="shell">
<header><div class="brand"><span class="brand-symbol" aria-hidden="true">✧</span><div><h1>星露配方</h1><span class="eyebrow">THE STARDEW ATELIER</span></div></div><button id="help" class="quiet">玩法指南 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button></header>
<main>
<aside class="intro"><div class="edition">NO. 01 — 微光调制室</div><h2>让数字，<br>酿成一瓶星光。</h2><p class="intro-copy">循着铜线，读懂配方。<br>每一个恰好的数字，都让微光靠近一点。</p><div class="bottle-scene" aria-hidden="true"><div class="orbit orbit-one"></div><div class="orbit orbit-two"></div><span class="spark s1">✦</span><span class="spark s2">✧</span><div class="bottle"><div class="stopper"></div><div class="neck"></div><div class="glass"><div class="liquid"></div><div class="bottle-star">✧</div><div class="bottle-label">STELLA<br><small>星 露 · 01</small></div></div></div><div class="bottle-shadow"></div></div><p class="aside-note">不必赶时间。<br>一点线索，也能照亮下一格。</p></aside>
<section class="workbench" aria-label="配方实验台">
<div class="bench-top"><div><span id="chapter-label" class="eyebrow"></span><h2 id="level-title"></h2></div><button id="chapters" class="quiet">配方册 <span id="progress">0/60</span></button></div>
<div class="progress-track"><div id="progress-fill"></div></div>
<div class="recipe-top"><span id="stage"></span><span id="cage-count"></span></div>
<div id="board" class="board" role="group" aria-label="配方棋盘"></div>
<p class="rule-line" id="rule-line"></p>
<div id="selection" class="selection" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div id="keypad" class="keypad" aria-label="数字盘"></div>
<div class="tools"><button id="note" aria-pressed="false">✎ 候选</button><button id="erase">⌫ 擦除</button><button id="undo">↶ 撤销</button><button id="hint">✧ 提示</button></div>
<div id="message" class="message" role="status">选中一格，放入合适的数字。</div>
<div id="win" class="win" hidden><div><strong>✧ 星露调制完成</strong><p id="win-copy"></p></div><button id="next" class="primary">下一配方 →</button></div>
<div class="bench-footer"><button id="restart" class="text-button">重新调制</button><span id="save-state">本地自动保存</span><button id="daily" class="text-button">每日调制 ↗</button></div>
</section>
<aside class="journal"><div class="journal-heading"><span>调 制 手 记</span><span>✧</span></div><h3 id="chapter-name"></h3><p id="chapter-tip"></p><div class="divider"></div><div class="formula-sample"><span id="sample-label"></span><small id="sample-meaning"></small></div><p class="small">粗铜线围起一只算笼。<br>左上角是它的目标与运算。</p><div class="divider"></div><h4>六册 · 星露收藏</h4><div id="collection" class="collection"></div><p class="small">每完成一个不同配方，<br>为这一册收下一点星光。</p><button id="collection-open" class="text-button">翻开全部配方 →</button></aside>
</main><footer class="page-footer"><span>60 个配方 · 6 册微光</span><span>基于 Keen 算笼拉丁 · AI 辅助独立制作</span></footer>
</div>
<div id="modal" class="modal" hidden><section class="dialog" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="modal-title"><div class="modal-head"><span class="eyebrow" id="modal-eyebrow">ATELIER NOTES</span><button id="close-modal" aria-label="关闭弹窗">×</button></div><div id="modal-content"></div><div id="modal-actions" class="modal-actions"></div></section></div>
<script src="./app.js"></script>
</body></html>
